==Description==
'''Mind Blown''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}. 

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a shocked Default Level 2 [[Scout]] with a green explosion coming out of it's head.

==Trivia==
*The sticker was actually a submission for the 2023 [[Discord Art Contest Winners|Discord Sticker Art Contest]] where it was one of the multiple developer choices.
**This also makes it the first and so far only sticker to not be made by squeezewhiz.
*The description used by all the unreleased stickers was likely first created for '''Mind Blown''', then was copied over to every single.
*The sound that plays when using the '''Mind Blown''' sticker originates from the game  ''Undertale''.

